          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Support from field parameters is available from version 2.0 onwards. You can handle field parameters in multiple ways, either:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. [Deneb-specific] consolidate field parameters and their values into array values that you can transform (which requires no further changes to your model and is more portable)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. [Historical workaround] customize the field parameter definition within your model to keep the provided field name to Deneb consistent (which only works for specific scenarios)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "There are examples of both implementations below, showing how you can work with them as needed. Option 1 is the recommended approach, but any visuals migrated from version 1 (or imported via a template authored with version 1) will default to option 2 in order to preserve functionality, in case a visual may use the historical/unsupported approach."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Deneb's website has extensive documentation",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "color": "#e045a8"
                    },
                    "url": "https://deneb.guide/docs/field-parameters"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " for how to work with field parameters and how to leverage transforms in Vega or Vega-Lite."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
